# Ojer Axonil: "If a red source you control would deal an amount of noncombat damage less than Ojer Axonil's power to an
# opponent, that source deals damage equal to Ojer Axonil's power instead." (CR 614.1a) Bot1 casts Ojer Axonil on turn 1 off Mox Ruby, a Mountain, Mox Pearl and Mox Jet.
# On turn 2 Bot2 Lightning Bolts Bot1: a red source, but Bot2's, so 3. On turn 3 Bot1 Lightning Bolts Bot2: 3 is less
# than Ojer's power, so 4. Then Bot1 Lightning Bolts its own Ojer Axonil: not an opponent, so 3, which the 4/4 survives.

